handNote.seg:
Divine names; names of the donors of  Text 1.3; groups of lines in some
                           sections in Text 1.3; incipit of sections of Text 1.3;
                           initial line of each paragraph in the 34th miracle of Text 1.3 (); elements of the punctuation marks and of the text dividers;
                           elements of Ethiopic numerals.

binding.decoNote:
Reddish-brown tooled leather cover, blind tooled ornament (at least 8 tools
                           were used: triple line fillet, double circle, corni-from, 
                           wave form, double crescent, small x, double sine wave with dots, cross hatching); 
                           quarter cover made of strong vermilion leather, blind tooled ornament (at least 2 tools
                           were used: double circle, wave form); 
                           textile inlays.
